sequenceDiagram
  participant G as Guest
  participant B as Browser
  participant N as Next.js gallery route
  participant R as Gallery repository
  G->>B: Open signed gallery URL
  B->>N: GET /gallery/[token]
  N->>N: Verify signature, expiry, nonce, token version, availability
  N->>R: Resolve gallery and media in gallery scope
  alt no valid visitor cookie
    N-->>B: Entry form
    G->>N: Submit visitor details and gallery-entry consent
    N->>R: Upsert GalleryVisitor
    N-->>B: Signed 12-hour HTTP-only cookie
  else valid visitor cookie
    N-->>B: Authorized gallery
  end
